tvGarchKF Fortran translation
=============================

The upstream R package tvGarchKF 0.0.1 was authored by Guillermo Ferreira and
Tomas Arancibia and is distributed under GPL version 3 or later.

This repository is an independent modern Fortran translation of its
computational code. It is not endorsed by the upstream authors.

The local GARCH-window estimator reuses source from the supplied independent
Fortran translation of fGarch. The upstream fGarch package is GPL version 2 or
later; those vendored source files retain their notices. The combined package
is distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later.

The original archives and source snapshots are retained under reference/ for
license and provenance purposes.
